{"4131380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Adventurer’s Guild Manager", "steam_appid": 4131380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your own adventurer's guild, create quest contracts, trade magical items, and meet new adventurers. Grow your guild in a stylized cozy low poly world and connect adventurers with clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Guild:</strong> Unlock and build different structures to customize your guild's growth, appearance, and capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create Custom Contracts:</strong> Design every contract with unique titles, descriptions, visuals, rewards, and tone to attract the adventurers you're looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131380/extras/5de0b678cce33070893fc16e9bc99e2b.poster.avif?t=1785407856\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131380/extras/5de0b678cce33070893fc16e9bc99e2b.webm?t=1785407856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131380/extras/5de0b678cce33070893fc16e9bc99e2b.mp4?t=1785407856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade Magical Items:</strong> Meet adventurers face to face, negotiate deals, and build your fortune through smart trading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131380/extras/557c83c389072e8256fbe85f7a2e68e7.poster.avif?t=1785407856\